{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seedrun</strong> is a short, minimalist farming game with many satisfying tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, water crops, pluck weeds and harvest your plants before they spoil.  <br>Your crops can assist you with your tasks by watering seedlings, getting resources &amp; more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875810/extras/ef168cf775bc2e2958915bd4cf75afe0.poster.avif?t=1765227015\" width=956 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875810/extras/ef168cf775bc2e2958915bd4cf75afe0.webm?t=1765227015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood &amp; stone to build bridges so you can expand your farm and discover even more plants and buildings.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875810/extras/63cd6e1fb6c48904713329062615a011.poster.avif?t=1765227015\" width=956 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875810/extras/63cd6e1fb6c48904713329062615a011.webm?t=1765227015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: Complete quests to grow the Skill Tree until it is tall enough for you to climb out of the cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875810/extras/6742d69524718e17929906c34b713082.poster.avif?t=1765227